    "detailed_description": "Would you like to live the life of a famous Hollywood director and create your own blockbuster movie? How about acting in your own Jurassic Park, Star Wars, Avengers or Terminator?<br><br>Now you can. <strong>Hollywood Director The Simulation\u00ae </strong>is the complete Hollywood movie production simulator.<br><br><strong>SET DESIGN</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/SET_DESIGN_INTERIOR.GIF?t=1749634071\" /></span><br>\u2022\tStart by selecting your ideal movie location from dozens of pre-built virtual sets such as apartments, offices, warehouses, bars, restaurants Wild West saloons space stations or cyberpunk cities<br><br><strong>CUSTOM SETS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/SET_DESIGN_EXTERIOR.GIF?t=1749634071\" /></span><br>\u2022\tCustomise these sets by deleting or adding objects from hundreds of high-quality 3D models in the library<br>\u2022\tRepaint every model using your own chosen colour, texture or material<br>\u2022\tBuild lanscapes with sprawling cities, canyons, deserts, flowing rivers, trees, bushes and fauna<br><br><strong>CAMERA MOVEMENT</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/CAMERA.GIF?t=1749634071\" /></span><br>\u2022\tTake complete control of the camera using Hollywood standard techniques such as pan, track, tilt, zoom and Steadicam<br>\u2022\tAdd camera effects such as camera shake and soft focus<br><br><strong>LENSES AND ASPECT RATIOS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/LENSES.GIF?t=1749634071\" /></span><br>\u2022\tSelect the correct lenses for each shot such as Hollywood standard Cooke Prime lenses (12mm to 180mm)<br>\u2022\tChoose the right aspect ratio for your blockbuster such as 4:3, 1.66:1, 16:9, 1.85:1, 2.39:1 or 2:75:1<br>\u2022\tSelect your aperture (F-Stop) settings from f1.4 to f/22.0<br><br><strong>LIGHTING</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/LIGHTING.GIF?t=1749634071\" /></span><br>\u2022\tChoose from dozens of lighting prefabs suitable for any movie genre such as a romantic comedy, a superhero action adventure, a Wild West epic, a musical or a horror movie<br>\u2022\tCreate your own custom lighting prefab by tweaking the advanced lighting features such as intensity, fade off distance, gamma and colour<br><br><strong>POST-PROCESSING EFFECTS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/BLOOM.GIF?t=1749634071\" /></span><br>\u2022\tBring your scenes to life by adding effects such as bloom, chromatic aberration, lens distortion, motion blur and depth of field<br><br><strong>CASTING</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/8875faff6f1052ddfd3a9914ff6fc76f.avif?t=1749634071\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>\u2022\tChoose from hundreds of pre-built character models, male, female, transgender, demons, space marines or zombies<br>\u2022\tCreate your own custom actors by tweaking skin, eye colour, height, body shape and hair style<br>\u2022\tAct in your own blockbuster by adding your face to the virtual actor from a single selfie<br><br><strong>COSTUMES</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/b31cd423c549ef9fa04bab80f48aa5c6.avif?t=1749634071\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>\u2022\tChoose your characters\u2019 attire from hundreds of costume prefabs such as shoes, skirts, bikins, frocks, trousers, blouses, kimonos or saris<br><br><strong>ANIMATIONS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/ANIMATIONS.GIF?t=1749634071\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>\u2022\tGet your virtual actors walking, jumping, somersaulting or flying like a superhero using the thousands of animations in the library<br><br><strong>CHARACTER LIPSYNC</strong><br>\u2022\tRecord your own audio and lipsync your characters<br><br><strong>SURROUND SOUND</strong><br>\u2022\tCreate a full surround soundscape by adding dozens of sound effects to each shot<br>\u2022\tAdd a sound effect to any object or animation<br>\u2022\tTweak the volume, pitch and reverb of each sound effect<br><br><strong>VISUAL EFFECTS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/VFX_1.GIF?t=1749634071\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>\u2022\tBring your blockbuster to life by adding visual effects such as explosions, lasers or superhero-style magic spells<br>\u2022\tAdd dynamic physics-based effects such as destruction, fragmentation<br><br><strong>WEATHER EFFECTS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/VFX_2.GIF?t=1749634071\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>\u2022\tCaptivate your audience using environmental effects such as fog, rain, snow, tsunamis and blizzards<br><br>TOON SHADING<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/597c7da74a148a0ab9c6e0ae2be5cbbd.avif?t=1749634071\" width=640 height=236 /></span><br>\u2022\tTurn your photoreal scenes into stylized 2D toon or anime-style ones<br><br><strong>EDITING</strong><br>\u2022\tRender each shot of your movie in multiple resolutions for any format from mobile phones to IMAX screens<br>\u2022\tCreate Hollywood-style opening and closing title sequences<br><br><strong>MODDING</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189560/extras/9615282ae272327fa29647b9df2592e1.avif?t=1749634071\" width=640 height=498 /></span><br>\u2022\tCreate your own mods with customised sets, characters, lighting, audio and visual effects<br>\u2022\tShare it with the community directly from within the game",
